Effect:
 (dispatched ?candidate)
 (vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit)
 (dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot)

Thus to dispatch a schedule_candidate, we need dispatch_allocated, candidate_vehicle_linked, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked.

